        "wiki:drakehoundsstep"
      ,
        "riot:P"
      ],
      "topic": "Frozen dash-indicator privacy exceeds supplied evidence"
    },
    {
      "resolution": "Use the detailed shield-absorption condition: champion, large-monster, or turret damage during bracing.",
      "source_ids": [
        "riot:W",
        "wiki:repudiation"
      ],
      "topic": "Broad non-minion wording versus enumerated empowerment sources"
    },
    {
      "resolution": "Retain possible smash relocation. Keep the brace-versus-dash timing qualification in metadata.",
      "source_ids": [
        "wiki:repudiation"
      ,
